DECL	{"args":[{"name":"a","sort":{"sort":"track"}}],"body":{"and":[{"args":[{"var":"a"}],"derived":"drv_motion_turning_right","params":[{"param":"yaw_tolerance"},{"param":"speed_tolerance"}]},{"rises":{"cmp":"le","lhs":{"heading_since":"a","max_step":{"param":"step"},"onset":{"args":[{"var":"a"}],"derived":"drv_motion_turning_right","params":[{"param":"yaw_tolerance"},{"param":"speed_tolerance"}]}},"rhs":{"neg":{"param":"turn_angle"}}}}]},"contract":"Road user a turns to the right from an observed onset: over one continuous stretch in which it moves and its heading turns to the right, its heading changes to the right by at least the turn angle, the heading change below which turning counts as no change of course. Measured as drv.motion.turning_right (with the yaw tolerance and the speed tolerance) holding at every observation since the observation at which it last became true, and the heading change since that observation (integrated from kin.yaw_rate, degrees, left positive, with the step bound, the largest interval between consecutive observations integrated across) at or below the negative of the turn angle. The act's observed beginning is the observation at which drv.motion.turning_right last became true. The act is recognized at the observation at which the heading change since that beginning first reaches the negative of the turn angle. The concept holds at the recognition observation only. Conduct before the observed beginning is no part of the act, and where that beginning is not observed (the stretch began before the recording, or an unknown turning state could hide its start) whether the act occurred is unknown. A stretch that ends before its heading change reaches the negative of the turn angle is no turn; a road user that follows a bend of the way through that angle turns in this sense. Not a stand-in for the turn indicator or a declared intention to turn, nor for a lane change, whose heading change stays short of the turn angle.","definition":null,"id":"drv.motion.right_turn_from_onset","kind":"formula","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"turn_angle","unit":"degree"},{"name":"yaw_tolerance","unit":"degree_per_second"},{"name":"speed_tolerance","unit":"metre_per_second"},{"name":"step","unit":"second"}],"residues":[],"supersedes":null}
